Dominion is a 2018 Australian documentary film filmed primarily with drones and hidden cameras inside Australian slaughterhouses and macro-farms with the aim
to expose an opaque and inhumane system, according to the film's writer, director, and producer, Chris Delforce, an animal rights activist.

11
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film documents multiple animal abuse industries in Australia, especially
agricultural livestock, while focusing its message on animal rights.

